      "description": "Meta CEO Mark Zuckerberg now owns an actual castle. Zuckerberg and his wife Priscilla Chan bought Strancally Castle and its 440-acre estate in Ireland \"several weeks ago,\" according to The Irish Times. While the exact price of the purchase is unclear, the family could have paid \"anywhere between &#8364;20 million and &#8364;30 million\" for the [&#8230;]",
